87735f91088adac3.en:
- the method is idempotent — tables and indexes that already exist are not recreated (`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS`,
  `CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS`);
- on failure (no DDL permissions) return `false` or throw an exception — the framework logs the error and keeps working;
- new columns in future umbot versions will appear in `DB_TABLES_SCHEMA` — add the missing ones (`ALTER TABLE ... ADD
COLUMN`), not just create the table.

